="01:24.780" end="01:24.960">the </span><span begin="01:24.960" end="01:25.890">American </span><span begin="01:25.890" end="01:26.670">dream</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.700" end="01:29.340"><span begin="01:26.700" end="01:27.000">I </span><span begin="01:27.000" end="01:27.420">see </span><span begin="01:27.420" end="01:27.570">your </span><span begin="01:27.570" end="01:27.990">name </span><span begin="01:27.990" end="01:28.200">in </span><span begin="01:28.200" end="01:29.340">lights</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.430" end="01:31.620"><span begin="01:29.430" end="01:29.910">We </span><span begin="01:29.910" end="01:30.180">can </span><span begin="01:30.180" end="01:30.600">make </span><span begin="01:30.600" end="01:30.780">you </span><span begin="01:30.780" end="01:30.870">a </span><span begin="01:30.870" end="01:31.620">star</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.620" end="01:34.110"><span begin="01:31.620" end="01:32.040">Girl</span><span begin="01:32.040" end="01:32.040">, </span><span begin="01:32.040" end="01:32.220">we'll </span><span begin="01:32.220" end="01:32.550">take </span><span begin="01:32.550" end="01:32.820">the </span><span begin="01:32.820" end="01:33.210">world </span><span begin="01:33.210" end="01:33.450">by </span><span begin="01:33.450" end="01:34.110">storm</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.170" end="01:36.060"><span begin="01:34.170" end="01:34.410">It </span><span begin="01:34.410" end="01:34.860">isn't </span><span begin="01:34.860" end="01:35.160">that </span><span begin="01:35.160" end="01:36.060">hard</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.090" end="01:38.970"><span begin="01:36.090" end="01:36.420">'Cause </span><span begin="01:36.420" end="01:36.540">I </span><span begin="01:36.540" end="01:36.750">got </span><span begin="01:36.750" end="01:36.870">your </span><span begin="01:36.870" end="01:37.740">picture </span><span begin="01:37.740" end="01:37.860">I'm </span><span begin="01:37.860" end="01:38.190">coming </span><span begin="01:38.190" end="01:38.520">with </span><span begin="01:38.520" end="01:38.970">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.970" end="01:41.550"><span begin="01:38.970" end="01:39.360">Dear </span><span begin="01:39.360" end="01:40.140">Maria</span><span begin="01:40.140" end="01:40.140">, </span><span begin="01:40.140" end="01:40.530">count </span><span begin="01:40.530" end="01:40.920">me </span><span begin="01:40.920" end="01:41.550">in</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.580" end="01:45.540"><span begin="01:41.580" end="01:41.940">There's </span><span begin="01:41.940" end="01:42.060">a </span><span begin="01:42.060" end="01:42.930">story </span><span begin="01:42.930" end="01:43.320">at </span><span begin="01:43.320" end="01:43.470">the </span><span begin="01:43.470" end="01:44.250">bottom </span><span begin="01:44.250" end="01:44.520">of </span><span begin="01:44.520" end="01:44.790">this </span><span begin="01:44.790" end="01:45.540">bottle</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.540" end="01:46.830"><span begin="01:45.540" end="01:45.750">And </span><span begin="01:45.750" end="01:45.930">I'm </span><span begin="01:45.930" end="01:46.080">the </span><span begin="01:46.080" end="01:46.830">pen</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.890" end="01:52.170"><span begin="01:46.890" end="01:47.370">Make </span><span begin="01:47.370" end="01:47.550">it </span><span begin="01:47.550" end="01:48.210">count </span><span begin="01:48.210" end="01:48.930">when </span><span begin="01:48.930" end="01:49.350">I'm </span><span begin="01:49.350" end="01:49.560">the </span><span begin="01:49.560" end="01:50.040">one </span><span begin="01:50.040" end="01:50.250">Who's </span><span begin="01:50.250" end="01:51.030">selling </span><span begin="01:51.030" end="01:51.360">you </span><span begin="01:51.360" end="01:52.170">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.200" end="01:54.750"><span begin="01:52.200" end="01:52.710">'Cause </spa